## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100, 120105, 16000, 16001, 16002, 16005

# **The five-digit `16xxx` numbers are the camelot client and they are a guess.** The packager reads
# `16???` as that game type, and its build is 1.60.1, so 16001 is the likely one. `/camelot` prints
# what `GetBuildInfo` actually answers; put that number here and drop the others. Until then, a miss
# only means the addon list shows this one out of date.

## Title: Debind Dev
## Notes: Development-only addon for Debind: the in-game test kit, the written development profile, and one-shot probes.
## Author: mundi4
## Group: Debind
## SavedVariables: DebindDevDB

# **No dependency on Debind, and that is what makes this addon work.** Debind names this one in
# `OptionalDeps`, so this one loads first, and the rest of the group hard-depends on Debind, so it
# is in front of all of them. `DevSeed.lua` has to reach `_G.DebindVars` before Debind's own
# `ADDON_LOADED` runs `InitDB`, and only an addon ahead of Debind can. Declaring a dependency here
# would move this behind Debind and buy nothing back: the moment Debind loads is already reachable
# from `ADDON_LOADED`.
DevSeed.lua

DebindTest.lua
Probe_Camelot.lua
